      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C74CC5D0C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어느 포켓몬을 보여 줄 거야?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B2900020D3ECCF13BAACC7440020BCF4C5EC0020C9040020AC70C57C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어머, 너의 <U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+0001>...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4BA38002C0020B108C75800200010000201010001002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너와 엄~청나게 절친인가 보구나!\n함께 있으면 행복한 모양이야!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108C6400020C5C4007ECCADB098AC8C0020C808CE5CC778AC000020BCF4AD6CB0980021000AD568AED80020C788C73CBA740020D589BCF5D55C0020BAA8C591C774C57C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너, <U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+0001><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0003> 너무 좋아서\n항상 곁에 두고 있구나!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108002C0020001000020101000100100002190000030020B108BB340020C88BC544C11C000AD56DC0C10020ACC1C5D00020B450ACE00020C788AD6CB09800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너와 <U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+0001><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001>\n지금보다 훨씬 멋진 콤비가 될 수 있을 거야!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108C640002000100002010100010010000219000001000AC9C0AE08BCF4B2E40020D6E8C52C0020BA4BC9C40020CF64BE44AC000020B4200020C2180020C788C7440020AC70C57C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "꽤 사이가 좋구나~\n그렇지만 좀 더 친해질 수 있을 것 같아!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AF640020C0ACC774AC000020C88BAD6CB098007E000AADF8B807C9C0B9CC0020C8800020B3540020CE5CD574C9C80020C2180020C788C7440020AC830020AC19C54400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "조금은 친해진 것 같은...\n그런 느낌적인 느낌...?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
